It might be possible to rethink your code a little and use scale_y_datetime().

Alternatively, have a look at the "breaks =" and "labels =" parameters of scale_y_continuous(). This would result in code that looks something like:

ggplot(…) +
geom_jitter(…) +
scale_y_continuous(breaks = …, labels = …) +
facet_wrap(…)

You’d need to breaks “breaks” as well as the matching “labels” character vector (“labels” is what is actually displayed; breaks is where the labels are displayed).

Good luck,

Tom

